        "rationale": "All three pull_request/push workflows (deploy, docs-site, tests) got deliberate decisions, the schedule-only and issue-driven ones were explicitly considered and left as not file-triggered, and the required `unit-tests` check uses exactly the prescribed shape: a single workflow with no workflow-level paths/paths-ignore, a computed `salient` step output that gates every later step with `if:` and fails open on unknown ranges, with no companion skip workflow reporting the same context."
